  "question": {
    "text": "The first order rate constant for the decomposition of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>700</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and activation energy is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>209</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Its rate constant (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is (Nearest integer)<br />[Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>;</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>79</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>62</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  },
