  "correct_answer": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>700</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>600</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>209</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p><p>Applying :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>700</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>600</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"norma